libfwevt
------------------------------------------
libfwevt is a library for Windows XML Event Log (EVTX) data types.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime1-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid1-20260521-1bl1
  libfwevt-devel-20260702-1bl1
  libfwevt1-20260702-1bl1
  libfwnt1-20260602-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfwnt-devel-20260602-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfwevt

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfwevt/archive/refs/tags/20260702.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfwevt-20260702-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfwevt-20260702-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfwevt-20260702-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfwevt-20260702-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfwevt1-20260702-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfwevt-devel-20260702-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libfwevt-20260702-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfwevt)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfwevt.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfwevt/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfwevt/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfwevt/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfwevt/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfwevt/README

(libfwevt1)
  /usr/bin/cygfwevt-1.dll

(libfwevt-devel)
  /usr/include/libfwevt.h
  /usr/include/libfwevt/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfwevt/error.h
  /usr/include/libfwevt/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfwevt/features.h
  /usr/include/libfwevt/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfwevt.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfwevt.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfwevt.3.gz

(python312-libfwevt)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfwevt.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

